			"notes": "# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3\n## Changes:\n- Netherian now have -25% Attack Speed instead of -25% Block Breaking Speed, as described in the race info\n- Orebringer gravity changed to +20%, Oakhearted jump strength to +50% and Palehearted jump strength to +25%, as described in the race info\n- Atlantic Shot, Breeze Shot and Void Shot now shoot 5 projectiles, as described in the scroll info\n- Each race now starts with its own default ability hotkey (Aetherian: Jump, Netherian & Turtlekin: Sprint, all others: Crouch), still changeable in the Player Settings\n- Villager Hats can now rarely be bartered from Descendants\n- Decoy scrolls can now be obtained from Enchanting Tables\n\n## Fixes:\n- Scout and Survivor class abilities not working\n- Crown of Roots not working for Endlings\n- Netherian and Oakhearted Treasures containing each other's loot\n- Moonshroud Shelters and Treasures generating in Oakhearted biomes\n- Netherite Hatchet and Netherite Throwing Knife sharing the same recipe\n- Stormcall scroll info not mentioning its limit of 5 targets\n- Back buttons in menus not showing their label"
